r.1{txt "3. Press in this empty bar, then N. 4. Press /: grace entry is on. 5. Type 5. 6. Press / again: grace entry ends. 7. Type 7, then the Right arrow key: a quarter 7 with a grace 5 before it. 8. Press Esc."} |
